This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.440
Beginning of December, 1590 - Kyoto - Sanjō Street

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:49.350
These are some very interesting tea bowls you're selling.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:52.290
They aren't for sale, though.

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:56.790
Lord Furuta Oribe is just displaying his personal collection.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:02.370
Don't give me that. I heard he gave several to the daimyo.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:06.290
You're trying to drive the prices up through good word of mouth, right?

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:09.620
You pulling the same thing Master Rikyū did in Sakai?

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:15.060
If that's the case, can you sell me one, Master Setoya?

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:17.930
I've always wanted one of these painted tea bowls.

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:20.680
The ones from China are just too expensive for me to bite.

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:24.220
These are made here, so it shouldn't be that expensive, right?

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.430
I want one, too!
Me, too!

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:33.970
New Guilty Partner

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:43.230
So the market is saying our bowls are just replicating the Chinese ones?

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:48.180
The eyes of the people in the capital are sharp.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.320
Please reexamine yourself.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:06.910
Reexamine and delete...

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.830
What's left will be...

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:24.680
Something that can be under the name of Furuori and open up the true door to imperfection.

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:32.080
If I remain in B-class, then those merchants are right.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:36.200
Each bowl sold for 100 kan in the end.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:41.560
Not bad for those picky merchants to advertise for us.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.790
How does this bode for the Ten Works of Oribe?

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:48.840
It's good enough. As a locally-made ware, the price is high.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:55.150
But we are thinking about profits and we are still a long way from Lord Furuta's estimates.

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:59.960
We can't even pay for my troops and I'm not A-class.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:03.150
Oh well, I can only blame myself here.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:09.460
Setoya has to keep on rolling in the money.

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:11.370
I brought something nice.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.760
How about using this sign in front of the store?

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:36.460
The way of tea follows the Five Elements.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:40.140
This five-sided star displays those elements.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:46.220
I'm sure fans of tea will be quite moved.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:49.410
They'll be aiming for the stars like me!

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.130
What's with those faces?

00:04:56.300 --> 00:05:00.470
I'm just a bit embarrassed by this B-grade star...

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.220
Beginning of January, 1591 - Musashi Province - Edo

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.720
I think it's about time for lunch.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:26.390
Finally. No wonder I feel so hungry.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.650
Time to eat!

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.700
This is quite tiring.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.730
Yeah! It's tough!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:45.930
A plain rice ball with pickled vegetables can taste this good.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:49.350
Working myself hard once in a while feels pretty nice.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:55.680
I hope this won't be a common occurrence, or else we as your vassals will lose face.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:06:00.990
I know. The number of days where I can work like this is numbered.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:05.400
I need to quell the rebellion at Ōu tomorrow.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:12.190
They're already going crazy when it's the New Year.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:22.380
We've already prepared a letter for Date.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:25.910
I hope you can stop the chaos.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:31.510
In any case, we need to have Date come to the capital and apologize to the Chief Advisor himself.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.680
I'll be getting spoiled at the capital again.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.310
I have a report!

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:42.490
A woman from Azabu village would like to speak with milord!

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.630
Why are you bothering him with such petty matters?

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:47.640
I told her that,

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:50.090
but she says she'll kill herself if she can't meet with you!

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.740
Please kill the one who murdered my husband!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:01.920
We loved each other very much and made a living on the fields.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:05.940
But bandits came last year...

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:09.190
And set fire to our residence...

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.310
Isn't this story a bit long?

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.340
My husband protected the village with all of his might,

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:20.560
but in the end... He was killed and thrown into the river!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:28.290
Please, Lord Tokugawa! You're the only one left I can count on!

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:32.420
I understand! Set up a bed immediately!

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:45.260
Excuse me. Your raw emotions got to the better of me and I couldn't control myself.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:51.040
This is part of my job. I will kill the murderer.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:55.630
Bring your daughter with you and come live with me.

00:07:57.890 --> 00:08:00.530
Milord! Master Rikyū sent a letter from Kyoto!

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:02.070
Hmm?

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.170
An invitation to a tea ceremony?

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:13.270
Seems like I'll be stuck in Kyoto for a while again.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.720
I want to see it soon.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:23.270
When Edo becomes the city of justice.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:28.550
Hizen Province - Nagoya Castle Construction Grounds

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:45.130
Lord Katō Kiyomasa is full of energy.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:50.270
The other lords are still scrambling to get funds. What a guy.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:57.400
I heard that he'll get a big chunk of land in China after a successful invasion.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.570
No wonder he's working so hard.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.940
Yes, this is a nice gate.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:15.250
We've widened the path like you told us.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:19.730
We can fire a lot of arrows from here to kill our enemies easily.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:21.250
That's not enough.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.020
The main gate needs to be even more menacing.

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:29.800
Just like how a tiger bears its fangs at incoming foes.

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:36.080
These gates are the fangs of a castle. We must make them fearsome.

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:41.080
That's the "beauty of design." Master Rikyū mentioned it before.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.320
Yes, we have learned a lot again.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:47.840
A castle is the tiger itself.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:53.190
Strong and gorgeous, with everything in its place.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.000
That is my ideal.

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:58.730
I am betting everything I have as an aesthete.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:03.090
The Chief Advisor wants to make Nagoya a city.

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:06.440
I'm sure he'll be overjoyed if we can build a wonderful castle.

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:10.650
I heard that Lord Tokugawa is working hard, too.

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:15.790
He does not want Edo in the east to lose to Kyoto so he is building a pretty good castle.

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:22.120
That has nothing to do with me.

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:27.870
That's good over there! Move on to the next one!

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.270
No! No! No!

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:42.290
I told you already that you can't build the walls the normal way!

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.310
You need to stuff small pebbles within the cracks.

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:48.990
The walls must be smooth, like the back of a stretching tiger!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:53.070
Otherwise the castle won't be able to withstand earthquakes and it makes it easier for enemies to scale the walls!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.450
We were careless! We will fix this immediately!

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:03.990
What about the invitation to Master Rikyū's tea ceremony?

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:14.960
I cannot go. I must make this the number one castle in the heavens first.

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:19.090
End of January - Residence of Ueda Satarō

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:46.710
Hmm... Tea's not bad.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:48.610
Just kidding!

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:49.510
Eh!?

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:53.100
Your tea room looks quite nice,

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:56.170
but doesn't it feel like you're just copying Master?

00:11:57.060 --> 00:12:00.830
People will lose interest and the tea will lose its taste.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:06.790
Don't be losing your creativity now that you're happily married.

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:12.970
Thanks to your influence, I am able to attend Master's tea ceremony.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:17.920
But I'm always getting told like this so I don't have much confidence.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:23.530
I know, I know. You must know who you are first.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:29.750
But I used the painted tea bowl you gave me.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:34.110
My tea ceremony may be bland, but this bowl has gotten a lot of praise.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.440
It's valued quite highly.

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:45.890
Lord Sanada from the east and Lord Mōri from the west both want one.

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:50.790
That's why I have something to ask you.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:51.510
Huh?

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:54.830
Can you make containers other than tea bowls?

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:57.350
What do you mean?

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:02.630
I am no good at cooking, but I have an eye for plates.

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:06.650
I don't want to ask you for money.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:11.820
Well, we are all strapped for cash.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:14.620
You can return the money after it becomes popular.

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:15.400
So that means...

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:25.530
The tea bowl is rated highly. Perhaps I should make some plates, too?

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:28.080
But what a joke.

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:33.150
That design isn't even A-class, and it's already so highly praised.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.440
No, I cannot be satisfied already.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:42.140
I must find out who I truly am.

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:48.890
Yamato Province - Kōriyama Castle

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:54.110
Please do not stay long.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:56.410
Lord Hidenaga may have come to,

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:59.890
but your continual visits have tired him.

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:04.690
I, Kuroda Jyosuui, am just a man who sells medicine.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:08.540
Boil some of this and have the lord drink it. It will do wonders.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:21.850
No need for you to get up, Lord Hidenaga.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:25.000
I'll leave after I say my greetings.

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:27.880
I'm really sorry.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:39.680
You helped Toyotomi in our quest to rule the heavens.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:44.220
You've worked so much without being rewarded...

00:14:48.060 --> 00:14:51.250
Please don't worry about that. It's not good for your body.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:56.070
Our plan for invading China is going well.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:15:04.620
All thanks to Master Rikyū for holding tea ceremonies for all of the daimyo.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:16.000
Were you invited by him, too?

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:19.630
What did Master Rikyū say?

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.790
Nothing much.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:32.510
No... We must stop him...

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:39.990
He must be plotting something.

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:47.790
For true imperfection to spread across the land... As revenge for Sōji...

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:58.230
Call someone quickly... Please, Lord Kuroda...

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:21.050
Lord Kuroda...

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:06.380
As expected of the brains behind the Chief Advisor.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:12.240
You had plans of your own as soon as you heard about Master Rikyū's whereabouts.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:24.550
That's how you were able to evade the poison all this time.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:35.740
Bad luck for you, Lord Hidenaga.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:40.670
I've heard everything from Master Rikyū.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:52.420
You tricked me into stepping on thin ice.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:56.430
And set the path for Hashiba to rule the heavens.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:38.520
My individual actions here today will lead to results.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:45.590
This has nothing to do with Master Rikyū's plots. I am only enacting my own revenge.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:59.530
Someone! Is anyone there!? Lord Hidenaga's sickness has turned for the worse!

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:27.560
I will be honored to perform Lord Hidenaga's funeral service.

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:42.740
You seem not in the mood for tea. Let me drink it for you.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.540
What do you think about the size of two tatami?

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:51.780
I brought you here to hear your opinion.

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:58.320
Don't you think the small space makes the guest uneasy?

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:03.840
If I may interject, I agree.

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:10.490
Do you really think the words of an uncommon aesthete can have any sway in this world?

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:19.660
Does your position as the tea master really matter?

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:28.600
Is Ogin serving you well?

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:35.550
I have no complaints. However, you still have not handed over the Hashitate tea pot.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:46.530
I received something nice. It may serve as a replacement for you.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:51.970
A Baku is a supernatural being that is said to devour nightmares.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:58.920
Perhaps with the passing of Lord Hidenaga, you'll need this as your pillow to sleep well.

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:14.100
Lord Hidenaga...

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.440
Lord Oribe!

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:24.250
Long time no see, my young aesthete.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.710
Please give this to your father.

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:32.090
I'm sure things will get tough with Lord Hidenaga's death.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:37.530
I hope this Imayaki tea bowl can cheer him up.

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:40.680
Yes!

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:44.760
I finally understand it now.

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:48.750
How important of a man Lord Hidenaga was.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:52.060
The world may be changing.

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:56.980
That's because the Chief Advisor wants me to become the tea master.

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.490
That will be sad.

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:03.760
What has the world come to, for such an impure way of tea to spread?

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:07.600
You keep saying such things. That's why you never get far.

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:11.590
I don't care who becomes the head tea master.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:15.530
The Master's imperfection will still be the ultimate perfection.

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:22.050
In any case, perhaps it's time for me to really take a good look at myself.

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:24.120
Lord Oribe!

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:28.240
I heard you've been making tea bowls.

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:32.230
You're the only one that can go head-to-head with Master Rikyū.

00:22:32.670 --> 00:22:35.500
Can I have one of your bowls, too?

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:37.540
Lord Oribe!

00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:38.720
Lord Furuta!

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:41.410
Please give me one, too!

00:22:41.550 --> 00:22:42.430
Me, too!

00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:43.220
Please!

00:22:43.570 --> 00:22:44.000
I beg you!

00:22:47.190 --> 00:22:49.970
Maybe you should turn a new leaf and become a pottery artisan.

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:06.170
Everytime I　

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:06.170
Anata no mune

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:08.560
feel your heart

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:08.560
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:14.650
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:14.650
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.570 --> 00:23:20.830
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.570 --> 00:23:20.830
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:26.990
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:26.990
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:33.080
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:33.080
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:36.960
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:36.960
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:40.540
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:40.540
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.740 --> 00:23:46.410
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.740 --> 00:23:46.410
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.510 --> 00:23:49.410
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.510 --> 00:23:49.410
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:52.020
Without each other.

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:52.020
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:52.980
You should

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:52.980
Soshite

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:58.480
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:58.480
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:02.270
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.590 --> 00:24:02.270
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:07.980
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:07.980
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.060 --> 00:24:14.470
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.060 --> 00:24:14.470
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.530 --> 00:24:20.270
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.530 --> 00:24:20.270
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.750 --> 00:24:26.250
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.750 --> 00:24:26.250
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:36.160 --> 00:24:37.910
What a transient moon.

00:24:40.830 --> 00:24:42.580
Like Akechi's wife...

00:24:47.970 --> 00:24:49.570
Tell me softly.

00:24:50.230 --> 00:24:52.510
You're the Chosen One.

00:24:53.220 --> 00:24:58.120
To be a warrior or an aesthete? That is the question.

00:24:56.220 --> 00:24:59.510
You're the Chosen One
